  "title": "Draft: dfilter: Fix invalide 3GPP filters",
  "description": "The parser is choking on the name 3GPP-*** because it starts\nwith a digit followed by a minus sign. This is only a syntax\nerror for protocol names. \"3gpp-foo\" protocol would be invalid, but\n\"diameter.3gpp-foo\" is OK as a diameter field name.\n\nFixes #19493.",
